meta {
  name: Resource Comments - List
  type: http
  seq: 55
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/spaces/z40cggggsksggkgskkwocock/resources/<resource cuid>/comments?limit=100&offset=0
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  limit: 100
  offset: 0
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Comments on a resource of a resources space (#1034), oldest first, each with its replies. metadata.totalCount counts the replies too. Get a resource cuid with Resources - List. Offset pagination (limit, offset; metadata.pagination): at most 100 comments per answer, the replies counted (the default and largest limit is 100); a page that starts inside a thread has its top-level comment again, with the next replies only.
  Public: in a public space this request works without a session and without a token (the response carries the name, username and avatar of the authors, never more). Every other space answers 401 without an account.
}
